It would be straightforward to generate simulated data and compare estimates between different versions of the same dataset.  The different versions could be: 1) all sites sampled in both years, 2) few sites sampled in both years but all sites used for modeling, and 3) only the few sites sampled in both years used for modeling.

Obviously you're most interested in the comparison between #2 and #3 since you don't actually have #1 (it does provide context though).

